---
// src/pages/about.astro
import "../styles/global.css";

const title = "About me – joekamprad";
const description =
  "joekamprad – co-founder of EndeavourOS, janitor of the ISO, installer tinkerer and sway fan.";
const image = "/images/joegta6_big.png";

const links = [
  { label: "GitHub", href: "https://github.com/killajoe" },
  { label: "Telegram", href: "https://t.me/joekamprad" },
  { label: "Mastodon", href: "https://mastodon.social/@joekamprad" },
  { label: "EndeavourOS forum", href: "https://forum.endeavouros.com/u/joekamprad" },
  { label: "Open Collective", href: "https://opencollective.com/johannes-kamprad" },
];
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
	<title>{title}</title>
	<meta name="description" content={description} />
	<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
	<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
	<meta property="og:image" content={image} />
</head>
<body>
	<main class="about">
		<p class="prompt"><span>joe@kamprad</span>:~$ cat about.md</p>

		<div class="grid">
			<div class="col side">
			<!-- Portrait -->
			<section class="tile portrait focused" aria-label="Portrait">
				<img src={image} alt="joekamprad, GTA style" width="540" height="740" loading="eager" />
				<p class="bar">joe@kamprad</p>
			</section>

			<!-- Terminal -->
			<section class="tile term" aria-label="Short profile">
				<pre><code><span class="p">$</span> whoami
joekamprad [Der Doktor]

<span class="p">$</span> cat /etc/joekamprad/role
iso, installer, desktop-setups

<span class="p">$</span> echo $WM
sway  <span class="dim"># formerly: i3wm</span>

<span class="p">$</span> pacman -Qi endeavouros | grep founder
<span class="ok">yes.</span>

<span class="p">$</span> dd if=/dev/espresso of=/dev/joe
<span class="ok">40 ml copied, 28 s, 1.4 ml/s</span>

<span class="p">$</span> ./cook.sh --spicy
<span class="ok">warning: this may break your keyboard.</span></code></pre>
			</section>
			</div>

			<div class="col content">
			<!-- Who -->
			<section class="tile intro" aria-labelledby="who">
				<h1 id="who">joekamprad,<br />a.k.a. Der Doktor.</h1>
				<p class="lead">
					In the community they call me “Der Doktor”. On paper I’m one of the founders of
					EndeavourOS. In practice I prefer to call myself the janitor: someone has to keep the
					lights on, fix the doors and check that everything in the basement is still running.
				</p>
				<p>
					I’m a chef nerd addicted to getting things done. Whatever repeats itself becomes a
					script. Whatever can be explained becomes a tutorial.
				</p>
				<p>
					Away from the keyboard I’m a husband and a father of two grown-up kids. I love repairing
					things and building new ones, I play around with 3D printing, and I’m a coffee nerd. I’m
					also one of the last “real” Berliners: born here, lived here my whole life, never left.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- Technology -->
			<section class="tile work" aria-labelledby="workbench">
				<h2 id="workbench">Technology</h2>
				<p>
					I build and maintain the ISO and its live environment, design the installer and fix its
					bugs, and put together the preconfigured desktop setups. My favorite is the sway setup,
					formerly i3.
				</p>
				<p>
					Besides that, this is what you will find on this site:
				</p>
				<dl>
					<dt>DIY projects</dt>
					<dd>
						Things I build, fix and tune myself, from calibrating displays on Linux to getting a
						lever espresso machine just right.
					</dd>
					<dt>Thoughts</dt>
					<dd>
						Posts where I stop and think: about technology and where it leads us, about trust and
						scale in open source communities, and about the state of the world.
					</dd>
					<dt>Information</dt>
					<dd>
						Explainers, FAQs and warnings from daily Linux life: what works, what doesn’t, which
						tools to avoid and why, and how to survive the terminal.
					</dd>
				</dl>
				<p class="all"><a href="/blog/">Browse all posts</a></p>
			</section>
			</div>

			<!-- What is all this -->
			<section class="tile story" aria-labelledby="story">
				<h2 id="story">What is all this?</h2>
				<p>
					On this blog I show the things I find on the web and share my opinion on current
					political events, plus everything that has to do with tech, Linux, computers and
					cooking.
				</p>
				<p>
					The person writing it is a nerd, a cook, a typographer and a printer, a community
					architect and a mentor, a philosopher and writer. All of them get a say here,
					which is why a post about a kernel parameter can sit next to one about a good soup,
					or a thought on how we live together.
				</p>
				<p>
					You are welcome to disagree, and to share whatever is useful to you.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- Typewriter -->
			<section class="tile paper" aria-labelledby="typework">
				<h2 id="typework">#typework</h2>
				<p>
					My site has room for things that don’t fit into a package manager: an Olympia
					typewriter, a La Pavoni espresso machine from 1976, thoughts on net neutrality, on
					consumption and on how ten billion people will get enough to eat.
				</p>
				<p>
					I believe that an open net and open software belong together. Both live on the fact
					that many people are allowed to join in.
				</p>
				<p class="sig"><a href="https://kamprad.net/blog/hallo-welt/">– joekamprad, Planet Earth</a></p>
			</section>

			<!-- Links (bottom of the page, full width) -->
			<section class="tile links" aria-labelledby="find">
				<h2 id="find">Find me here</h2>
				<ul>
					{links.map((l) => (
						<li><a href={l.href} rel="noopener">{l.label}</a></li>
					))}
				</ul>
			</section>

		</div>
	</main>

	<footer class="footer">
		<div class="beer">
			<script
				is:inline
				type="text/javascript"
				src="https://cdnjs.buymeacoffee.com/1.0.0/button.prod.min.js"
				data-name="bmc-button"
				data-slug="joekamprad"
				data-color="#110a21"
				data-emoji="🍺"
				data-font="Bree"
				data-text="Buy me a beer"
				data-outline-color="#000000"
				data-font-color="#ffffff"
				data-coffee-color="#FFDD00"
			></script>
		</div>
		<nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer">
			<a href="/">← cd ~</a>
			<a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
		</nav>
	</footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>
	/* Uses the variables from global.css; only overrides the narrow main width. */
	.about {
		max-width: 68rem;
	}

	.grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
		align-items: start;
	}
	/* left column: portrait and terminal stacked; right column: intro and workbench */
	.col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; min-width: 0; }
	.side { grid-column: span 4; }
	.content { grid-column: span 8; }
	.story { grid-column: span 6; align-self: stretch; }
	.paper { grid-column: span 6; }
	.links { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

	.tile {
		background: var(--bg-elevated);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}
	/* focused tile, like the focus border in sway */
	.tile.focused { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }

	h1, h2 { line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
	h1 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
	h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; }
	h2::before { content: "## "; color: var(--accent); }
	.paper h2::before { content: ""; }
	p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
	p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.lead { font-size: 1.02rem; }

	/* portrait keeps the image's own proportions (width/height attributes set the ratio) */
	.portrait { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
	.portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
	.bar {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: var(--dim);
		border-top: 2px solid var(--accent);
	}

	.term { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
	.term pre { margin: 0; overflow-x: auto; font: inherit; font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.7; }
	.term code { font: inherit; }
	.p { color: var(--accent); }
	.dim { color: var(--dim); }
	.ok { color: var(--accent); }

	dl { margin: 0; }
	dt { font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1rem; }
	dt:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
	dd { margin: 0.2rem 0 0; color: var(--dim); }
	.all { margin-top: 1.25rem; }

	/* Typewriter sheet: the one outlier on the page */
	.paper {
		background: #f1ede1;
		color: #26231d;
		border-color: #f1ede1;
		font-family: "Courier Prime", "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
		transform: rotate(-0.2deg);
	}
	.paper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
	.paper .sig { margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: right; }
	.paper a { color: #4b3fb0; }
	.paper a:hover, .paper a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: #4b3fb0; }

	.footer {
		max-width: 68rem;
		margin: 2rem auto 0;
		padding-top: 1rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--dim);
	}
	/* home and privacy: bottom right */
	.footer-links { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; margin-left: auto; text-align: right; }

	.links ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; }

	@media (min-width: 861px) {
		.term, .paper { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.col { display: contents; }
		.side, .content, .story, .paper, .links { grid-column: auto; }
		.intro { order: 1; }
		.portrait { order: 2; }
		.term { order: 3; }
		.work { order: 4; }
		.story { order: 5; }
		.paper { order: 6; transform: none; }
		.links { order: 7; }
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
		.paper { transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
		.paper:hover { transform: rotate(0deg); }
	}
</style>